m.\n — e〉 *Flaschengurke.\n — f〉 *performance of certain gesticulations, accompanying the silent repetition of prayers, etc. in meditation on real or divine knowledge.\n — g〉 *N. pr. eines Weibes.\n— 6〉 *n.\n — a〉 Eisen.\n — b〉 Stahl RĀJAN. 13,46.\n — c〉 frische Butter.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["पिंड", "पिण्डं", "पिण्डः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["piMqa", "piRqaM", "piRqaH"]}], "piRqaka": [{"id": "piRqaka", "headword": "पिण्डक", "headword_slp1": "piRqaka", "fold": "piRqaka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "— 1〉 m.\n — a〉 Klumpen, Kloss; rundliche Hervorragung, Knöpfchen. मस्तकपिण्डक neben ˚पिण्डिक (von पिण्डिका) am Ende eines adj. Comp. die Ballen auf der Stirn eines brünstigen Elephanten. पिण्डका f. in der Bed. Klumpen, Ballen HEMĀDRI 1,433. wohl fehlerhaft.\n — b〉 Mehlkloss beim Manenopfer.\n — c〉 ein best. Knotengewächs RĀJAN. 7,69. (vgl. 21)\n — d〉 *Olibanum RĀJAN. 6,1. 6.\n — e〉 ein in Zahlen ausgedrückter Sinus.\n — f〉 ein Piśāca.\n— 2〉 f. पिण्डिका\n — a〉 kugelförmige Anschwellung, Fleischballen (an Schultern, Armen, Beinen u. s. w.) BĀLAR. 12,4. insbes. Du. die Waden VIṢṆUS. 96,92. Am Ende eines adj. Comp. पिण्डक (die v. l. meist पिण्डिक) in der Bed. Wade fehlerhaft.\n — b〉 Unterlage, Gestell eines Götterbildes oder eines Liṅga AGNI-P. 42,10. 43,29. 45,1. fgg. ˚पीठ KĀD. 253,19.\n — c〉 Bank, Erhöhung und dgl. zum Liegen.\n — d〉 *Nabe.\n — e〉 *eine Moschusart RĀJAN. 12,52.\n — f〉 Tamarindus indica. Richtig पिष्टिका\n— 3〉 *n.\n — a〉 Daucus carota.\n — b〉 Myrrhe.", "gloss_language": "de"}, {"gloss": "पिण्डक IV. *Bissen, magerer B. MAHĀVY. 262,2.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["पिंडक", "पिंडकं", "पिंडकः", "पिण्डकं", "पिण्डकः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["piMqaka", "piMqakaM", "piMqakaH", "piRqakaM", "piRqakaH"]}], "piRqakanda": [{"id": "piRqakanda", "headword": "पिण्डकन्द", "headword_slp1": "piRqakanda", "fold": "piRqakanda", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-